{"seq":7,"slug":"geography","title":"七年级地理","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/geography","introMarkdown":"# 七年级地理 简介\n\n七年级地理是初中地理学习的第一年，学生将从认识脚下的地球开始，逐步建立对世界空间格局和中国地理概况的基本认知。这门课程培养学生从地理视角观察和理解自然与人文现象的能力。\n\n本内容共包含三个章节。第一章**地球基础**，讲解地球的形状与大小、经纬网的判读、地球的自转与公转及其地理意义，以及地图三要素和等高线地形图的阅读方法，帮助学生掌握地理学习最基本的工具和概念。第二章**世界地理**，介绍七大洲四大洋的分布与特征、全球主要的气候类型与分布规律、世界人口分布与人种语言宗教的多样性，以及发展中国家与发达国家的差异，构建学生对世界空间格局的整体认识。第三章**中国地理**，从中国的疆域与行政区划入手，讲解中国的地形地势特征、气候类型与河流水系，以及人口与民族的分布特点，帮助学生建立对祖国自然环境的系统了解。\n\n地理学习离不开地图。建议准备一本地图册，学习时随时对照地图确认方位和空间关系。经纬度和气候类型等知识需要多画多练，用填图和默图的方式加深记忆。关注天气预报和地理新闻，将课本知识与真实世界联结起来，地理就不再是枯燥的记忆科目。\n\n本内容适合七年级学生课堂配套使用，也可作为地理爱好者的入门读物。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"earth-fundamentals","title":"地球基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/geography/earth-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"earth-shape-motion","title":"七年级地理 — 地球的形状与运动","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/geography/earth-fundamentals/earth-shape-motion"},{"seq":2,"slug":"maps-scales","title":"七年级地理 — 地图基础与比例尺","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/geography/earth-fundamentals/maps-scales"},{"seq":3,"slug":"latitude-longitude","title":"七年级地理 — 经纬网与定位","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/geography/earth-fundamentals/latitude-longitude"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"world-geography","title":"世界地理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/geography/world-geography","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"continents-oceans","title":"七年级地理 — 大洲与大洋","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/geography/world-geography/continents-oceans"},{"seq":2,"slug":"climate-zones","title":"七年级地理 — 世界气候类型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/geography/world-geography/climate-zones"},{"seq":3,"slug":"world-population","title":"七年级地理 — 世界人口与城市","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/geography/world-geography/world-population"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"china-geography","title":"中国地理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/geography/china-geography","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"terrain-landforms","title":"七年级地理 — 中国的地形与地势","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/geography/china-geography/terrain-landforms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rivers-lakes","title":"七年级地理 — 中国的河流与湖泊","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/geography/china-geography/rivers-lakes"},{"seq":3,"slug":"administrative-regions","title":"七年级地理 — 中国的行政区划","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/geography/china-geography/administrative-regions"}]}]}